{"ID":"20240513083044-dodwd2a","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083044-dodwd2a","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083044-dodwd2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165700-18sgaa3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165700-18sgaa3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:454,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165700-18sgaa3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:527,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:527\u0026#125;","title":"264","type":"doc","updated":"20240514165218"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513165700-18sgaa3","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 835px;","id":"20240513165700-18sgaa3","updated":"20240514165218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/03"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"205-2 L, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Female"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50歲，稍瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/04/07"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"風寒濕痺，手關節紅腫已消失，疼痛好轉，食后腹脹，打嗝排氣仍有，鼻燥咽亁之症已除，記憶不好。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠好轉，因腹脹氣故睡不好。無盜汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下利己好轉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不渴"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手足不冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身不冷，心口熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、胃口:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 尚好，水利好轉。味覺好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胸阳不足，風寒濕痺在關節中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢，白朮五錢，桂枝六錢，炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吳苿萸三錢, 亁薑二錢，代赭石五錢，厚朴三錢，枳實三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉四錢，補骨脂三錢，益智仁三錢，陳皮三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮成三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪師曰：吃藥後中午肚子會餓就代表好了 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痛風可加白芍讓肌肉血液循環更好 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脹氣要從脾治，脾主少腹。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人先前有鼻燥咽亁是因腎水不足，故前方有補陰藥補骨脂，把腎水補足故藥後鼻燥咽亁已除。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝芍藥知母湯開方時麻黃、炮附子、白朮三者等量。知母是用來去虛熱的，痛風之處會發紅熱，此乃虛熱，裡面有堵住，陽熱進不去故跑到皮膚上來，所以痛風者摸他皮膚會紅熱。此方真正用來止痛的是炮附子、防風。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有時候把脾陽健起來，脾之消化吸收好，就可吸收食物中的養分(陰)，則陰就補足了。例如糖尿病陰虛以此法治之，血糖會下降。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}